Model inline frames and HTML attributes

```
[a](/u){href=/v}
.
<p><a href="/u">a</a></p>
```

```
![a](/u){src=/v}
.
<img src="/u" alt="a">
```

```
=>g=
.
<p>=&gt;g=</p>
```

```
[[][]]()
.
<p><a href="">[][]</a></p>
```

```
::: footnotes
x
y
.
<div class="footnotes">
  <p>x
y</p>
</div>
```

```
{{ d @lines:0 }}*a*
.
<p>{{ d @lines:0 }}<strong>a</strong></p>
```
